2026-10-25T02:37:01.3987100Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-25T02:37:01.4985720Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5011300Z [0m
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5012240Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5013250Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5013680Z 
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5014160Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5015190Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5015810Z 
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5016680Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5017560Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5017760Z 
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5018220Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5018640Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5019060Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5019430Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5019600Z 
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5019820Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5020110Z 
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5020250Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5020560Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5020670Z 
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5020750Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5020870Z 
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5021110Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5021730Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5035010Z 
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5036390Z I will:
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5036800Z 
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5037140Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5038140Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5038970Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5040860Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5041560Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5042140Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5043820Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5044130Z    /var/root
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5069960Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5070550Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5117140Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5119050Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5120140Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5123850Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5124240Z 
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5124510Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-25T02:37:01.5124820Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
